---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="simple-page">
    <h1>About Orlisse Living</h1>

    <p>
      Orlisse Living is a modern lifestyle publication for readers who care about
      living well — and living thoughtfully. We cover the five pillars of an elevated
      everyday life: fashion, beauty, travel, home & garden, and consumer technology.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Name</h2>
    <p>
      Orlisse is a coined word that combines <em>or</em> (French for "gold," symbolizing
      quality and warmth) and <em>lisse</em> (French for "smooth" or "effortless").
      The name reflects our editorial philosophy: thoughtful curation that makes
      modern life feel a little more effortless.
    </p>

    <h2>What We Cover</h2>
    <p>
      We believe fashion, beauty, travel, home, and technology are not separate
      silos — they are interconnected parts of a single, intentional lifestyle. Our
      articles range from deeply researched buyer's guides and product reviews to
      personal essays, destination profiles, and practical how-to tutorials.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every recommendation on this site is based on firsthand experience,
      expert interviews, and thorough research. We never accept payment for coverage,
      and we disclose any affiliate relationships clearly and prominently.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Work</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Product testing:</strong> We use products in our daily lives before
      recommending them. When we cannot test a product directly, we rely on verified
      owner reviews, expert consensus, and published test data — and we tell you
      which approach we used.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Travel:</strong> We visit destinations in person whenever possible. When
      we haven't been somewhere ourselves, we rely on extensive research, local
      expert interviews, and cross-referenced traveler reviews — and we clearly
      label the article as a researched guide rather than a first-person account.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Updates:</strong> We revisit and update our articles regularly —
      especially product recommendations, where prices, availability, and model
      numbers change over time.
    </p>

    <h2>The Team</h2>
    <p>
      Orlisse Living is edited by a small team of writers and researchers with
      backgrounds in fashion editorial, beauty journalism, travel writing, interior
      design, and consumer technology. Our contributors include licensed estheticians,
      former fashion buyers, and tech reviewers who have tested hundreds of products.
    </p>
    <p>
      We are a fully independent publication. We are not owned by or affiliated with
      any retail group, brand, or media conglomerate.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Readers</h2>
    <p>
      Our readers are curious, discerning, and intentional about how they spend their
      time and money. They want to make informed choices — but they also want to
      enjoy the process. If that sounds like you, you're in the right place.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, feedback, corrections, or partnership inquiries? Reach us at
      <a href="mailto:hello@orlisseliving.com">hello@orlisseliving.com</a> or
      visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
